# Copy to center-portal-251.env (gitignored) — one line is enough:
# SSHPASS='your-root-password-for-192.168.6.251'
# 生产部署必填（否则不会覆盖 nginx 主 vhost；误装 center.example.com 会导致保存隧道时 nginx sync failed）：
# CENTER_SERVER_NAME='center.123.gd.cn'
# CENTER_NGINX_VHOST='/www/server/panel/vhost/nginx/center.123.gd.cn.conf'
# 部署时建议一并写入（否则不会更新 18443 vhost / CA 下载路径）：
# CENTER_SERVER_NAME='center.123.gd.cn'
